# .claude/ and ANTIGRAVITY_HANDOFF/ carry tracked, authoritative files
# (.claude/launch.json; the handoff review, prompts, and checkpoint records that
# AGENTS.md treats as durable). Ignoring the whole directory silently excluded
# every new file under them while their siblings stayed versioned, so only the
# genuinely local parts are ignored here.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills/
